1
00:00:00,020 --> 00:00:00,980
This brain chip

2
00:00:00,980 --> 00:00:01,540
lets you talk

3
00:00:01,540 --> 00:00:02,100
to someone

4
00:00:02,100 --> 00:00:03,620
just by thinking.

5
00:00:03,620 --> 00:00:04,180
Instead of using

6
00:00:04,180 --> 00:00:05,220
vocal cords,

7
00:00:05,220 --> 00:00:05,940
the chip reads

8
00:00:05,940 --> 00:00:06,820
neural impulses

9
00:00:06,820 --> 00:00:08,260
in your motor cortex,

10
00:00:08,260 --> 00:00:09,260
translating your thoughts

11
00:00:09,260 --> 00:00:10,420
into direct messages

12
00:00:10,420 --> 00:00:11,540
instantly.

13
00:00:11,540 --> 00:00:13,085
It works seamlessly—

14
00:00:13,085 --> 00:00:13,380
until

15
00:00:13,380 --> 00:00:14,260
your brain generates

16
00:00:14,260 --> 00:00:15,940
an intrusive thought.

17
00:00:15,940 --> 00:00:17,140
Humans have thousands

18
00:00:17,140 --> 00:00:18,740
of dark, unwanted thoughts

19
00:00:18,740 --> 00:00:19,700
every single day

20
00:00:19,700 --> 00:00:20,660
that we never intend

21
00:00:20,660 --> 00:00:21,780
to act on.

22
00:00:21,780 --> 00:00:22,580
The chip can't tell

23
00:00:22,580 --> 00:00:23,380
the difference between

24
00:00:23,380 --> 00:00:24,793
what you wanted to say...

25
00:00:24,793 --> 00:00:25,660
and the dark thought

26
00:00:25,660 --> 00:00:26,620
you were desperately

27
00:00:26,620 --> 00:00:27,840
trying to bury.
